# v0.26.0 — post-v0.25.12 work

**Baseline**: `v0.25.12` finalised at `a63b94a906` (2026-10-21). Sections below cover commits accrued on `main` after it, per the release-tag policy (`AGENTS.md`: the version's changelog is finalised in the tagged commit; later entries go to the next version's log).
**Date**: staged 2026-10-22 — committed at the bc-2 reset window close.
**Tag**: `v0.26.0` (pending; renamed from the working title `v0.25.13` per the operator's 22 Oct directive).

### v0.25.12 strays — shipped in v0.25.12, logged late

The tag commit itself and two earlier same-day commits missed the frozen v0.25.12 log:

- `a63b94a90` — `feat(monitoring): journal error anchor + escrow-residue timer and absent guard` (ATTEST-PROM-FOLLOW-1, #360) — shipped in v0.25.12, logged late. **This is also the v0.25.12 tag commit.**
- `0b9b6afeb` — `fix(edge): send the startup register through BlockchainRPCClient` (RESET-EDGE-REG-1, #358) — shipped in v0.25.12, logged late.
- `f5651b648` — `fix(monitoring): chmod 0644 textfile .prom writers before the atomic rename` (ATTEST-PROM-MODE-1, #359) — shipped in v0.25.12, logged late.

